        <!-- What changed -->
        <mxCell id="changes" value="&lt;b&gt;Changed since the July diagram&lt;/b&gt; (langgraph_pipeline_before_2026-07.drawio)&lt;br&gt;1. reveal node added: the run pauses until the child accepts the references; &quot;try again&quot; redraws them, at most 3 times.&lt;br&gt;2. char_ref_mod can send a flagged reference back to char_bible for one redraw (MAX_MOD_REDRAWS = 1).&lt;br&gt;3. regenerate returns to consistency_check, not generate_scene; the better of the two attempts is kept.&lt;br&gt;4. Output moderation runs on each page as soon as it is final, inside the loop (2026-08-13), not once at the end.&lt;br&gt;5. route_next_scene decides what happens next: draw a page, screen a page, or compose." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
